            <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconMonitor">M0.8 2 L13.2 2 L13.2 10.4 L0.8 10.4 Z M2 3.2 L12 3.2 L12 9.2 L2 9.2 Z M6.2 10.6 L7.8 10.6 L7.8 12.2 L6.2 12.2 Z M4 12.4 L10 12.4 L10 13.4 L4 13.4 Z</StreamGeometry>
            <!-- Console window with a prompt chevron and a cursor bar: a shell session (SSH / telnet). -->
